      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Montford’s historic district, added to the National Register of Historic Places in 1977, showcases homes influenced by Frank Lloyd Wright and other national architects.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
